menu "Quanta Library"

    config QUANTA_STD_FORMAT_SUPPORT
        bool "Enable std::format support"
        default y
        help
            Provide std::formatter specializations for quanta types where
            the toolchain provides <format>; toolchains without it (such as
            the GCC 12 of ESP-IDF 5.1) build without them. Disable to
            turn std::format support off.

endmenu
